{"title":"pulsar-使用","uid":"60ca558cb25c9d228d7fbb9446378807","slug":"消息队列/pulsar/使用","date":"2025-02-09T19:51:22.000Z","updated":"2025-04-06T13:24:21.276Z","comments":true,"path":"api/articles/消息队列/pulsar/使用.json","keywords":null,"cover":[],"content":"<h2 id=\"创建使用\"><a href=\"#创建使用\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"创建使用\"></a>创建使用</h2><ul>\n<li>docker 单机创建</li>\n</ul>\n<figure class=\"shiki Bash\"><div class='codeblock'><div class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br></pre></div><div class=\"code\"><pre><code>docker run -d -it \\\n    -p 6650:6650 \\\n    -p 8650:8080 \\\n    -v /Users/wulei/devTools/pulsar/data:/pulsar/data \\\n    --name pulsar-standalone \\\n    apachepulsar/pulsar:latest \\\n    bin/pulsar standalone</code></pre></div></div></figure>\n\n<ul>\n<li>可视化 pulsar-manager</li>\n</ul>\n<figure class=\"shiki Bash\"><div class='codeblock'><div class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br></pre></div><div class=\"code\"><pre><code>docker pull apachepulsar/pulsar-manager:v0.3.0\ndocker run -d -it \\\n    -p 9527:9527 -p 7750:7750 \\\n    -e SPRING_CONFIGURATION_FILE=/pulsar-manager/pulsar-manager/application.properties \\\n    --link pulsar-standalone \\\n    --name pulsar-manager\\\n    apachepulsar/pulsar-manager:v0.3.0</code></pre></div></div></figure>\n\n<ul>\n<li>创建 pulsar-manager admin 用户，用户名： admin 密码： apachepulsar</li>\n</ul>\n<figure class=\"shiki Bash\"><div class='codeblock'><div class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br></pre></div><div class=\"code\"><pre><code>CSRF_TOKEN=$(curl http://localhost:7750/pulsar-manager/csrf-token)\ncurl \\\n   -H 'X-XSRF-TOKEN: $CSRF_TOKEN' \\\n   -H 'Cookie: XSRF-TOKEN=$CSRF_TOKEN;' \\\n   -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n   -X PUT http://localhost:7750/pulsar-manager/users/superuser \\\n   -d '{\"name\": \"admin\", \"password\": \"apachepulsar\", \"description\": \"test\", \"email\": \"username@test.org\"}'</code></pre></div></div></figure>\n\n<ul>\n<li>Pulsar-manager 连接 pulsar 集群，注意使用容器名称+容器内部端口进行连接</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"/images/message/pulsar/01.PNG\" alt=\"img\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li>创建租户</li>\n</ul>\n<figure class=\"shiki Bash\"><div class='codeblock'><div class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></div><div class=\"code\"><pre><code>./bin/pulsar-admin tenants create lei-learn</code></pre></div></div></figure>\n\n<ul>\n<li>创建 namespace</li>\n</ul>\n<figure class=\"shiki Bash\"><div class='codeblock'><div class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></div><div class=\"code\"><pre><code>./bin/pulsar-admin namespaces create lei-learn/dev</code></pre></div></div></figure>\n\n<ul>\n<li>创建 topic</li>\n</ul>\n<figure class=\"shiki Bash\"><div class='codeblock'><div class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br></pre></div><div class=\"code\"><pre><code>/bin/pulsar-admin topics create persistent://lei-learn/dev/string\n# 创建5个分区的topic\n/bin/pulsar-admin topics create-partitioned-topic -p 5 persistent://lei-learn/dev/string</code></pre></div></div></figure>\n\n<ul>\n<li>显示某个 namespace 下的 topic</li>\n</ul>\n<figure class=\"shiki Bash\"><div class='codeblock'><div class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></div><div class=\"code\"><pre><code>/bin/pulsar-admin topics list lei-learn/dev/</code></pre></div></div></figure>\n","text":"创建使用 docker 单机创建 1234567docker run -d -it \\ -p 6650:6650 \\ -p 8650:8080 \\ -v /Us...","permalink":"/post/消息队列/pulsar/使用","photos":[],"count_time":{"symbolsCount":"1.4k","symbolsTime":"1 mins."},"categories":[{"name":"消息队列","slug":"消息队列","count":4,"path":"api/categories/消息队列.json"}],"tags":[{"name":"分布式","slug":"分布式","count":5,"path":"api/tags/分布式.json"},{"name":"消息队列","slug":"消息队列","count":4,"path":"api/tags/消息队列.json"},{"name":"中间件","slug":"中间件","count":4,"path":"api/tags/中间件.json"},{"name":"pulsar","slug":"pulsar","count":1,"path":"api/tags/pulsar.json"}],"toc":"<ol class=\"toc\"><li class=\"toc-item toc-level-2\"><a class=\"toc-link\" href=\"#%E5%88%9B%E5%BB%BA%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8\"><span class=\"toc-text\">创建使用</span></a></li></ol>","author":{"name":"WU LEI","slug":"blog-author","avatar":"/images/avatar.jpg","link":"/","description":"Code & Life <br> 道阻且长，行则将至","socials":{"github":"https://github.com/taeyang0126","twitter":"","stackoverflow":"","wechat":"","qq":"","weibo":"","zhihu":"","csdn":"","juejin":"","customs":{}}},"mapped":true,"hidden":false,"prev_post":{"title":"kafka-producer","uid":"c724f7cd895900f6c7acf1d94eaa1458","slug":"消息队列/kafka/Producer","date":"2025-02-09T19:52:22.000Z","updated":"2025-04-06T13:24:21.276Z","comments":true,"path":"api/articles/消息队列/kafka/Producer.json","keywords":null,"cover":[],"text":"重要参数 配置项 默认值 说明 示例 bootstrap.servers Kafka broker 地址 *properties*.put(ProducerCo...","permalink":"/post/消息队列/kafka/Producer","photos":[],"count_time":{"symbolsCount":"7.9k","symbolsTime":"7 mins."},"categories":[{"name":"消息队列","slug":"消息队列","count":4,"path":"api/categories/消息队列.json"}],"tags":[{"name":"分布式","slug":"分布式","count":5,"path":"api/tags/分布式.json"},{"name":"消息队列","slug":"消息队列","count":4,"path":"api/tags/消息队列.json"},{"name":"中间件","slug":"中间件","count":4,"path":"api/tags/中间件.json"},{"name":"kafka","slug":"kafka","count":3,"path":"api/tags/kafka.json"}],"author":{"name":"WU LEI","slug":"blog-author","avatar":"/images/avatar.jpg","link":"/",